	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Prime Suspect

Type the keyword (default @@) followed by a number:

• If it's prime, you'll get a confirmation plus a random fun fact about primes.
• If it's not, you'll see the closest primes above and below it, its prime factorization, and the full list of divisors.

Press ⏎ to copy the result to the clipboard, or ⌥⏎ to show it in large type.

The keyword is configurable in the workflow's user configuration.</string>
